1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,145
Notice something.

2
00:00:01,145 --> 00:00:08,046
The Dow process and alkali fusion stop at sodium phenoxide, a salt that dissolves in water.

3
00:00:08,046 --> 00:00:15,195
You must acidify at the end, with hydrochloric acid or even carbon dioxide, to set phenol free.

4
00:00:15,195 --> 00:00:18,593
Forgetting that step costs a mark every year.

